{
  "startedAt": "2026-10-11T15:18:43.040Z",
  "steps": [
    "Actual twelve-module/twenty-eight-capability runtime loads 128 native-admitted boxes with stable UUID rows, matching/total counts and UTF-16 declaration pointers. BOM/CRLF source includes escaped object keys and preceding astral Unicode. Real WebGL2 readPixels records explicit renderer identity.",
    "Trimmed Unicode lowercase name and UUID matching selects the same stable UUID, renders authored HTML as text and preserves keyboard/button focus across list rebuilds. Empty results preserve the hidden selection and inspector. Focus frames that selected box even outside results using a temporary camera; Reset restores identical authored-camera pixels. Search, focus and reset leave draft/disk bytes unchanged.",
    "Chinese, English and Japanese at 390 px retain the exact filter and selected UUID with readable scrollable results and inspector. All four navigation/view controls remain inside the visible viewport, with no horizontal overflow or inline-style CSP violations.",
    "Real source navigation accepts only the current complete snapshot and stable UUID, reparses native source and maps exact UTF-16 ranges into the CRLF-normalized textarea. The modal closes before source focus; the selected original declaration matches the object exactly despite BOM, escaped keys and preceding astral Unicode. Draft, owner and saved bytes remain unchanged.",
    "Explicit fixture source edits demonstrate ownership: an old preview cannot locate after a draft change. Valid refresh/reorder keeps the selected UUID and filter and rederives its new source index. Removing that selected declaration via ordinary source editing falls back to the first surviving UUID while retaining the unmatched filter; clearing reveals 127 rows. Navigation itself never creates a source proposal or saves these fixture edits.",
    "A silent raw textarea change without an input event invalidates source navigation and produces a refresh explanation. Invalid newer source retains the last valid display/index and blocks stale location; Cancel returns without writing or implicitly saving. Deferred close/query/owner/receipt failures are separately covered by the actual-controller unit harness.",
    "With WebGL2 alone explicitly injected unavailable, the preview truthfully reports no draw and disables temporary Focus, while the same native name/UUID search and exact source navigation remain usable. No renderer capability is required to select the author declaration.",
    "All navigation/view actions use the existing read-only preview assembly, without authoring, World, execution or Save callbacks. Saved bytes are still the original fixture. No installation, Android, physical-device or hardware-GPU assertion is made."
  ],
